abstract: >-
  Nelson is an array programming language for
  engineering and scientific computing.


  It provides an interpreter, a high-level language,
  plotting tools, and numerical libraries such as
  Boost and Eigen.


  It supports data structures such as cell arrays,
  structs, and linear systems.


  Its module and overload mechanisms let users add
  data types and operations.
